          "value": "\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{\\pi /9}^{\\pi /3}({sin}^{2}⁡(3\\theta )-{cos}^{2}⁡(\\frac{3\\theta }{2}))\\,\\text{d}\\theta ",
